sdiv3: x / 3, for x from -999 to 999, truncated toward zero. Inline: no call.
Listed at cells 10-26, with x in cell 90.
Copy cells 10-26 to where the program needs x / 3, with each 90 changed to the program's cell for x; the program goes on with x / 3 in the accumulator.
It overwrites the accumulator; x is kept.
Size 17 cells. It runs 17 instructions, straight through.
Exact over the domain.

